{"id":27546,"slug":"apart-from-you","title":"Apart from You","year":1933,"country":"Japan","duration":60,"spine":null,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/27546-apart-from-you","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/a37d26c23f96e4eba9a889935077c26a/4ZhkmFAB7NPyNZUWNt3cnAzfbyKHos_large.jpg","description":"For _Apart from You,_ Mikio Naruse turned his camera on the lives of working women, which he would continue to do throughout his long career. In this gently devastating drama, a critical breakthrough for the director, he contrasts the life of an aging geisha, whose angry teenage son is ashamed of her profession, with that of her youthful counterpart, a lovely young girl resentful of her family for forcing her into a life of ignominy. ","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Mikio Naruse","slug":"mikio-naruse"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Mitsuko Yoshikawa","role":"Kikue","slug":"mitsuko-yoshikawa"},{"actor":"Akio Isono","role":"Yoshio","slug":"akio-isono"},{"actor":"Sumiko Mizukubo","role":"Terugiku","slug":"sumiko-mizukubo"},{"actor":"Reikichi Kawamura","role":"Terugiku’s father","slug":"reikichi-kawamura"},{"actor":"Tatsuko Fuji","role":"Terugiku’s mother","slug":"tatsuko-fuji"},{"actor":"Yoko Fujita","role":"Terugiku’s sister","slug":"yoko-fujita"},{"actor":"Jun Arai","role":"Kikue’s husband","slug":"jun-arai"},{"actor":"Choko Iida","role":"Landlady of geisha house","slug":"choko-iida"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Mikio Naruse","slug":"mikio-naruse"},{"role":"Written by","person":"Mikio Naruse","slug":"mikio-naruse"},{"role":"Cinematography","person":"Suketaro Inokai","slug":null},{"role":"Production design","person":"Tatsuo Hamada","slug":null}],"pickedBy":[],"related":[967,752,816],"setFilms":[],"inSets":[1000789]}